A||||3||Jncomutt||Possble tranny problem??  2nd snapped clutch arm||||1||
Z||000000||Jncomutt||06-09-2001||10:42 PM||||Clutch arm snapped again...  This time it was in a different spot tho.  I'm wondering what the heck could be causing these damn things to keep snapping?  I don't beat up on my clutch, I drive normal, agressive sometimes but no like dumping the clutch or anything.  The clutch never felt difficult to press when it was working.. It wasn't as easy as the CRX, but didn't require much muscle either.  <P>So then what could be causing this?  Is it just that the one from 84 had hairline cracks then snapped under use, for it did sit for 10 years.  And my replacement was a modified one I welded together off an 86, could that be the reason for that one?  So here I am, with no junkyards open tomorrow, already missin my car.  I'm going to go crazy searching again monday, but should I check something else before I put it all together???||||reg||1
Z||000001||Jncomutt||06-10-2001||09:37 AM||||-bump-      Anyone have any ideas??||||reg||1
Z||000002||sjp777||06-10-2001||12:18 PM||||Most likely the bushings of the fork shaft are clogged with clutch dust which reduces the clearances and makes the shaft bind.<P>The clutch arm then gets put under a lot of stress trying to move it.<P>The early clutch arms were stamped steel which were replaced after 86 with a forged alloy unit. The steel ones are known to crack.<P>Sounds like you replaced the 84 stamped steel one with another stamped steel one from an 86.<P>You need a post-86 alloy replacement and you might consider replacing the clutch and having those bushings cleaned out for more clearance to prevent binding of the shaft.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/890sm_4.jpg">     <BR>88GT 5sp, in desperate need of an LT1<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/</A><P><p>[This message has been edited by sjp777 (edited 06-10-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||Jncomutt||06-10-2001||12:54 PM||||Hey, Thanks alot.  I look into that and tell you what I come up with...||||reg||1
